## The Qualification System (Org-Configurable)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The problem statement says `Company size > 50` and `Timeline < 3 months` are **"Examples only"**. So the criteria MUST be configurable per organization, not hardcoded.

### How It Works

Each org defines their own qualification criteria in the dashboard:

```
┌─ Org: "NovaCRM" ──────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                        │
│  Required Fields:  name, company, role, use_case       │
│                                                        │
│  Conditions:                                           │
│    • company_size  >=  50                               │
│    • timeline      <=  "3 months"                       │
│                                                        │
│  [Save Criteria]                                        │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

A different org could set completely different criteria:

```
┌─ Org: "DevToolsCo" ───────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                        │
│  Required Fields:  name, company, role, tech_stack      │
│                                                        │
│  Conditions:                                           │
│    • company_size  >=  10                               │
│    • budget        >=  "$5000"                          │
│                                                        │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### New Supabase Table: `qualification_criteria`

| Column | Type | Example |
|--------|------|---------|
| `id` | UUID | auto |
| `org_id` | UUID (FK → orgs) | "abc-123" |
| `required_fields` | JSONB | `["name", "company", "role", "use_case"]` |
| `conditions` | JSONB | `[{"field": "company_size", "op": ">=", "value": 50}, {"field": "timeline", "op": "<=", "value": "3 months"}]` |
| `created_at` | timestamp | auto |

**Default criteria** (used if org hasn't configured custom ones):
- Required: name, company, role, use_case
- Conditions: company_size >= 50, timeline <= 3 months

