## KB Resources (Structured — Not Just Text)

> [!WARNING]
> The problem statement says: **"Recommend 2–5 specific product spec links and platform videos strictly from the controlled source."**
> Our current KB stores only raw text chunks. We need structured resource records.

### New Supabase Table: `kb_resources`

| Column | Type | Example |
|--------|------|---------|
| `id` | UUID | auto |
| `org_id` | UUID (FK → orgs) | "abc-123" |
| `title` | text | "SalesGen Intent Scoring — Product Spec" |
| `url` | text | "https://docs.salesgen.ai/intent-scoring" |
| `type` | text | `"spec"` / `"video"` / `"doc"` / `"guide"` |
| `description` | text | "Detailed spec of the real-time intent scoring pipeline" |
| `tags` | JSONB | `["intent", "scoring", "pipeline"]` |
| `created_at` | timestamp | auto |

### How Resources Get Used

```
When lead is UNQUALIFIED:
    → Query kb_resources by org_id + relevance to conversation
    → Return 2-5 structured results:
      { title, url, type, description }
    → AI says: "Here are some resources that might help:
       📄 SalesGen Intent Scoring Spec — docs.salesgen.ai/intent-scoring
       🎥 Platform Demo Video — youtube.com/watch?v=xyz
       📄 Integration Guide — docs.salesgen.ai/integrations"
```

### Dashboard: Resource Management Page

Orgs can add/remove their resources from the dashboard:

```
┌─ Knowledge Resources ──────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                         │
│  📄 Product Spec Sheet     https://docs.example.com/... │
│  🎥 Platform Demo Video   https://youtube.com/watch?... │
│  📄 Integration Guide      https://docs.example.com/... │
│  🎥 Customer Case Study   https://youtube.com/watch?... │
│                                                         │
│  [+ Add Resource]                                       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

