## Tool Integrations

### 📧 EmailJS (Free Tier — 200 emails/month)
- When lead is **Qualified**, LLM drafts a personalized confirmation email
- Email content uses extracted checklist data
- Template variables: `{{to_name}}`, `{{company}}`, `{{role}}`, `{{use_case}}`, `{{meeting_link}}`
- Fires client-side from widget — no backend email server

### 📅 Calendly (Free Tier — Unlimited meetings)
- Already integrated in our codebase (`calendly_link` stored in integrations table)
- **Change**: Trigger on `qualification_status == "qualified"` instead of `score > 71`
- Embed Calendly inline in the widget when qualified

