## Demo Scripts

### Path 1: Qualified Lead ✅
```
Visitor: "Hi, I'm interested in your product"
    → AI: "Welcome! I'd love to help. Could I get your name to start?"
    → Checklist: 0/6

Visitor: "I'm Sarah, VP of Sales at Acme Corp"  
    → Extracts: name=Sarah, company=Acme Corp, role=VP of Sales
    → Checklist: 3/6 ✅✅✅

Visitor: "We need a tool to qualify inbound leads automatically"
    → Extracts: use_case="inbound lead qualification"
    → Checklist: 4/6 ✅✅✅✅

Visitor: "We have about 200 sales reps"
    → Extracts: company_size=200 → checks org criteria (>=50 ✅)
    → Checklist: 5/6

Visitor: "Need this live before end of Q2"
    → Extracts: timeline="~2 months" → checks org criteria (<=3mo ✅)  
    → Checklist: 6/6 → STATUS: QUALIFIED 🟢
    → 📧 EmailJS fires confirmation email to Sarah
    → 📅 Calendly link shown: "Let's schedule a 30-min demo!"
```

