Visitor: "Just me, solo operation"  
    → Extracts: company_size=1 → checks org criteria (>=50 ❌)
    → STATUS: UNQUALIFIED 🔴
    → AI: "Thanks for your interest! Here are some resources:
       📄 SalesGen Product Spec — salesgen.ai/docs/spec
       🎥 Platform Overview Video — youtube.com/watch?v=abc
       📄 Quick Start Guide — salesgen.ai/docs/quickstart"
